      "writtenOn": "2021-03-10T10:51:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My understanding is that this error message is emitted when Soong looks for a non-hermetic tool but it can\u0027t find it, which is different from finding it and it being disallowed (which the message says)\n\nThe way this works, at least in production, is that $PATH points to the directory created for path_interposer ($OUT_DIR/.path) and which contains every binary on the user\u0027s $PATH, not just the allowlisted ones. So this code finds xcrun under $OUT_DIR/.path .",
      "parentUuid": "9a9a7fb9_341a7bd2",
